    {
      "label": "route327-single-untie-holmes",
      "cmd": "CUT ROPE WITH KNIFE",
      "text": " to fill you in as well.\"\n \n>REMOVE HAT\nYou take off your hat. Disconcerted by your sacrilegious action, Akbar averts his gaze. Inside you see an ampoule of etherium.\n \n>GET AMPOULE\nMoriarty's normally emotionless features dissolve in rage. He shouts at Akbar, \"Why didn't you take that from him when you brought him in?\"\n \nThe outburst startles Akbar into momentary inaction, but he quickly recovers and starts to come towards you with a violent look in his eyes.\n \n>HOLD BREATH\nYou take a deep breath. Holmes notices your action and surreptitiously does likewise.\n \n>BREAK AMPOULE\nYou break open the ampoule. The etherium is released into the room. You see everyone but Holmes pass out.\n \n>GET KNIFE\nYou take the knife.\n \n>CUT ROPE WITH KNIFE\nYou untie Holmes, keeping the rope.\n \nYou can't hold your breath much longer...\n \n> \nMonday    2:08:00 a.m.03:00 a.m.        m.m..m.                       ",
